To All University Faculty Members and Fellow Students,

I am a student in the Department of Mechanical Engineering at the Technion -
Israel Institute of Technology.  I am also a member of the Technion
Academic Committee. This Committee consists of four students and four
professors, and is responsible for planning agendas and proposals for the
Technion's governing body, the "Senate". The Committee is attended by the
Dean of Students, the Dean of Undergraduate Studies, the Technion
President's Assistant for Academic Affairs, and various other Technion
VIP's (who are not Committee members). The President of the Technion drops
in from time to time.

